#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md:6
msgid "AccuracyBasedSurrogateSwitcher"
msgstr "AccuracyBasedSurrogateSwitcher"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md:8
msgid ""
"The mechanism for dynamically switching `SurrogateManager` or "
"`OptimizationStrategy` based on surrogate accuracy is made of three "
"independent concerns, combined."
msgstr "サロゲートの精度に応じて`SurrogateManager`や`OptimizationStrategy`を動的に切り替える仕組みは、3つの独立した関心事の組み合わせでできています。"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md:10
msgid ""
"**Accuracy metric** (`SurrogateAccuracyMetric`): Computes a scalar value "
"from a single fit/predict pair"
msgstr "**精度指標**（`SurrogateAccuracyMetric`）：1回のfit/predictペアからスカラー値を計算する"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md:11
msgid ""
"**Accuracy evaluation method** (`AccuracyEvaluator`): Decides how to "
"measure the surrogate's generalization performance using the accuracy "
"metric (cross-validation, held-out, etc.)"
msgstr ""
"**精度評価方法**（`AccuracyEvaluator`）：精度指標を使って、サロゲートの汎化性能をどう測るか（交差検証、held-"
"outなど）を決める"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md:12
msgid ""
"**Switching decision** (`AccuracyBasedSurrogateSwitcher`): Takes the "
"evaluation result and decides which component or parameter to use next"
msgstr "**切り替え判断**（`AccuracyBasedSurrogateSwitcher`）：評価結果を受けて、次に使うコンポーネントやパラメータを決める"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md:14
msgid ""
"The accuracy evaluation method is injected as the `accuracy_evaluator` "
"argument on things like `GlobalSurrogateManager`, and its result is "
"passed to the switching decision via the "
"`surrogate_manager.last_accuracy` property. This whole mechanism is meant"
" to be used inside an `iterate()` loop. Because the high-level API "
"(`minimize`/`maximize`) provides no way to swap components mid-run, these"
" Switchers can't be used there."
msgstr ""
"精度評価方法は`GlobalSurrogateManager`などの`accuracy_evaluator`引数として注入され、その結果は`surrogate_manager.last_accuracy`プロパティを経由して切り替え判断へ渡されます。"
" この一連の仕組みは`iterate()`ループでの利用を前提としています。 "
"高レベルAPI（`minimize`/`maximize`）は実行中のコンポーネント差し替え手段を提供しないため、これらのSwitcherは使えません。"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md:18
msgid "SurrogateSwitcher's role"
msgstr "SurrogateSwitcherの役割"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md:20
msgid ""
"It separates and combines the accuracy metric, accuracy evaluation, and "
"switching decision to choose the next `SurrogateManager` or "
"`OptimizationStrategy` configuration."
msgstr "この仕組みは、精度指標、精度評価、切り替え判断を分離して組み合わせ、次に使う`SurrogateManager`または`OptimizationStrategy`の構成を決めます。"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md:22
msgid "Accuracy metric: SurrogateAccuracyMetric"
msgstr "精度指標：SurrogateAccuracyMetric"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md:24
msgid ""
"`SurrogateAccuracyMetric` requires two things to be implemented: `name` "
"(a property) and `compute(y_true, y_pred) -> float`."
msgstr ""
"`SurrogateAccuracyMetric`が実装を要求するのは`name`（プロパティ）と`compute(y_true, y_pred)"
" -> float`の2つです。"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md
msgid "Class"
msgstr "クラス"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md
msgid "Range"
msgstr "範囲"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "意味"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md
msgid "`SpearmanCorrelation`"
msgstr "`SpearmanCorrelation`"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md
msgid "`[-1, 1]`, higher is better"
msgstr "`[-1, 1]`、高いほど良い"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The average per-objective Spearman rank correlation. Based on the view "
"that rank preservation matters for EA {cite}`yu2019spearman`"
msgstr "目的ごとのSpearman順位相関の平均。EAではランクの保存性が重要という観点{cite}`yu2019spearman`に基づく"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md
msgid "`RMSE`"
msgstr "`RMSE`"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md
msgid "`[0, ∞)`, lower is better"
msgstr "`[0, ∞)`、低いほど良い"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md
msgid "Root mean squared error"
msgstr "二乗平均平方根誤差"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md
msgid "`R2Score`"
msgstr "`R2Score`"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md
msgid "`(-∞, 1]`, higher is better"
msgstr "`(-∞, 1]`、高いほど良い"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md
msgid "Coefficient of determination"
msgstr "決定係数"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md:32
msgid ""
"If `metrics` is omitted from `AccuracyEvaluator`'s constructor, all three"
" metrics are used by default."
msgstr "`AccuracyEvaluator`のコンストラクタで`metrics`を省略すると、この3指標全てが既定として使われます。"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md:34
msgid "Accuracy evaluation method: AccuracyEvaluator"
msgstr "精度評価方法：AccuracyEvaluator"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md:36
msgid ""
"`AccuracyEvaluator` requires only one method, `evaluate(surrogate, "
"train_x, train_y) -> SurrogateAccuracy`, to be implemented."
msgstr ""
"`AccuracyEvaluator`が実装を要求するのは`evaluate(surrogate, train_x, train_y) -> "
"SurrogateAccuracy`の1つだけです。"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md
msgid "Evaluation method"
msgstr "評価方法"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md
msgid "`KFoldAccuracyEvaluator`"
msgstr "`KFoldAccuracyEvaluator`"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md
msgid "`metrics=None, n_splits=5`"
msgstr "`metrics=None, n_splits=5`"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md
msgid "k-fold cross-validation, retraining a copy of the surrogate per fold"
msgstr "サロゲートをfoldごとに複製して再学習するk分割交差検証"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md
msgid "`LOOAccuracyEvaluator`"
msgstr "`LOOAccuracyEvaluator`"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md
msgid "`metrics=None`"
msgstr "`metrics=None`"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md
msgid ""
"Equivalent to `KFoldAccuracyEvaluator` with `n_splits=n_samples` (leave-"
"one-out cross-validation)"
msgstr "`n_splits=n_samples`の`KFoldAccuracyEvaluator`と等価（1件抜き交差検証）"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md
msgid "`HeldOutAccuracyEvaluator`"
msgstr "`HeldOutAccuracyEvaluator`"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md
msgid "`held_x, held_y, metrics=None`"
msgstr "`held_x, held_y, metrics=None`"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md
msgid ""
"Evaluates an already-fitted surrogate on the given held-out data, without"
" retraining"
msgstr "既にfit済みのサロゲートを再学習せず、指定したheld-outデータで評価する"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md:44
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`HeldOutAccuracyEvaluator` is used for comparison against recent true "
"evaluation points {cite}`hanawa2025switching`."
msgstr "`HeldOutAccuracyEvaluator`は、直近の真の評価点との比較用途{cite}`hanawa2025switching`で使います。"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md:46
msgid ""
"`SurrogateAccuracy` (`metrics: dict[str, float]`, `n_samples: int`) is a "
"simple container holding the evaluation result, with `get(name, "
"default=nan)` to retrieve a value by metric name."
msgstr ""
"`SurrogateAccuracy`（`metrics: dict[str, float]`, `n_samples: "
"int`）は、評価結果を保持する単純なコンテナで、`get(name, default=nan)`で指標名から値を取り出します。"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md:48
msgid "Switching decision: AccuracyBasedSurrogateSwitcher"
msgstr "切り替え判断：AccuracyBasedSurrogateSwitcher"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md:50
msgid ""
"`AccuracyBasedSurrogateSwitcher` requires only one method, "
"`switch(accuracy: SurrogateAccuracy | None) -> T`, to be implemented. It "
"chooses the next component or parameter from the accuracy result. "
"Applying that choice to the Runtime plan is a separate operation."
msgstr ""
"`AccuracyBasedSurrogateSwitcher`が実装する必要があるメソッドは`switch(accuracy: "
"SurrogateAccuracy | None) -> "
"T`の1つだけです。精度結果から次のコンポーネントまたはパラメータを選びます。その選択をRuntimeの計画へ適用する操作は別です。"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md:53
msgid ""
"The following example changes the configuration with `iterate()` and "
"`optimizer.set_*()`. The execution environment detects the change, "
"recompiles the plan, and applies it from the next generation. This "
"procedure works on both the Stage compatibility path and the graph-native"
" path."
msgstr "次の例では、`iterate()`と`optimizer.set_*()`で構成を変更します。実行環境が変更を検出して計画を再コンパイルし、次の世代から変更を適用します。この手順は、反復中に構成を変更する他のケースにも使えます。"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md
msgid "What it switches"
msgstr "切り替える対象"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md
msgid "`ManagerSwitcher`"
msgstr "`ManagerSwitcher`"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md
msgid "`primary, fallback, *, metric=\"spearman\", threshold=0.5`"
msgstr "`primary, fallback, *, metric=\"spearman\", threshold=0.5`"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md
msgid "`SurrogateManager`"
msgstr "`SurrogateManager`"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md
msgid "`StrategySwitcher`"
msgstr "`StrategySwitcher`"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md
msgid "`primary, fallback, *, metric=\"spearman\", threshold=0.56`"
msgstr "`primary, fallback, *, metric=\"spearman\", threshold=0.56`"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md
msgid "`OptimizationStrategy`"
msgstr "`OptimizationStrategy`"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md
msgid "`GenCtrlSwitcher`"
msgstr "`GenCtrlSwitcher`"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md
msgid ""
"`*, gm_max=5, gm_min=0, update_rate=0.5, metric=\"spearman\", "
"initial_error=0.5`"
msgstr ""
"`*, gm_max=5, gm_min=0, update_rate=0.5, metric=\"spearman\", "
"initial_error=0.5`"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md
msgid "`gen_ctrl` (an integer)"
msgstr "`gen_ctrl`（整数）"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md:70
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`ManagerSwitcher`/`StrategySwitcher` are simple binary switches, "
"returning `primary` if the specified metric is at or above the threshold,"
" and `fallback` otherwise. `StrategySwitcher`'s default threshold `0.56` "
"is based on the PS/IB-GB switching setting from "
"{cite}`hanawa2025switching`."
msgstr ""
"`ManagerSwitcher`/`StrategySwitcher`は、指定した指標が閾値以上なら`primary`、そうでなければ`fallback`を返す単純な二値切り替えです。"
" `StrategySwitcher`の既定閾値`0.56`は、{cite}`hanawa2025switching`によるPS/IB-"
"GB切り替えの設定値に基づきます。"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md:73
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Rather than a binary switch, `GenCtrlSwitcher` continuously adjusts "
"`gen_ctrl` via exponential smoothing {cite}`repicky2017genctrl`. Because "
"it holds state — a smoothed error estimate in the public attribute "
"`smoothed_error` — use one instance per `run`. The `int` returned by "
"`GenCtrlSwitcher.switch()` is meant to be passed directly to "
"[GenerationBasedStrategy](../execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md)'s "
"`gen_ctrl` argument."
msgstr ""
"`GenCtrlSwitcher`は、二値切り替えではなく`gen_ctrl`を指数平滑化で連続的に調整します{cite}`repicky2017genctrl`。"
" 公開属性`smoothed_error`に平滑化済みの誤差推定値を保持する状態を持つため、1回の`run`につき1つのインスタンスを使います。 "
"`GenCtrlSwitcher.switch()`が返す`int`は、そのまま[GenerationBasedStrategy](../execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md)の`gen_ctrl`引数に渡す想定です。"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md:77
msgid ""
"For the path where a component requests recompilation, see "
"[OptimizationStrategy](../execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md)'s "
"\"Behavior of runtime swapping\"."
msgstr "コンポーネント側から再コンパイルを要求する経路については、[OptimizationStrategy](../execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md)の「ランタイム差し替えの動作」を参照してください。"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md:79
msgid "Implementing a custom Switcher"
msgstr "独自Switcherの実装方法"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate_switching.md:81
msgid ""
"If you need custom switching logic, subclass "
"`AccuracyBasedSurrogateSwitcher` and implement only `switch()`."
msgstr "独自の切り替えロジックが必要な場合は、`AccuracyBasedSurrogateSwitcher`を継承して`switch()`だけを実装すればよいです。"

